# DRC-SUR-3: surround pc poly 1 absence_illegal (same plane); pc without poly, with poly, with 0 on one side.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 0 0 4 4
paint pc
box 9 -1 15 5
paint poly
box 10 0 14 4
paint pc
box 20 -1 25 5
paint poly
box 20 0 24 4
paint pc
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
